@startuml
title S4 - Suggest alternative Hubs (UC-M4-05): called by Reservation through Core
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
hide footbox
actor Student
boundary UI
control Reservation
control Core
control Allocation
Student -> UI: Reserve or return at Hub X
UI -> Reservation: Reserve or return request
Reservation -> Reservation: No vehicle or no parking space at Hub X
Reservation -> Core: Ask for alternatives (request type, Hub X, time)
Core -> Allocation: suggest_alternative_hubs(request) [read-only]
Allocation -> Core: Read network snapshot
Core --> Allocation: Snapshot with as_of
Allocation -> Allocation: Keep Hubs with the needed resource\nRank by closeness, remaining resources, battery, Hub ID\nKeep the top N
alt At least one Hub qualifies
  Allocation --> Core: Ranked list with as_of
else No Hub qualifies
  Allocation --> Core: Reason code NO_VEHICLE / NO_PARKING / ALL_HUBS_FULL (BR-M4-10)
end
Core --> Reservation: Result
Reservation --> UI: Error plus alternatives, or the reason
UI --> Student: Show message (nothing is reserved)
note over Allocation: Read-only: no resource is held.\nHolding an alternative is done later by Reservation.
@enduml
